{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act25side_level_act25side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act25side",
  "stageId": "act25side_01",
  "title": "迷霧重重",
  "storyCode": "CW-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c561980cf60b07a3b7977c9093fe16ad3fdffee4d3eb4e9d5baaf7cd742b56fb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上校，讓你等了半小時，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該抱歉的是我，副總統先生。您在特里蒙的行程排得很滿，我突然造訪，帕瓦爾秘書說您為此臨時取消了一個會議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "十三區的事情，你們的反應很迅速......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但也很激烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您剛剛在公眾面前進行了如此振奮人心的演講，十三區的變故出現得很不是時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來這件事情，對你們來說，同樣是不小的意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我只是說，“地平弧光計劃”或許並不適合這麼快展示給我們的民眾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也因此，我們希望您取消接下來的行程，離開特里蒙。我們也會盡快搞定這些“意外”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上校，我明白你們的訴求......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我的行程不會改變，相反，我甚至會在特里蒙多待上一段時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在剛剛結束的會議裡，我已經決定前往萊茵生命參觀，和我們優秀的科研人員們好好交流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布萊克上校，我們是一個整體，我們都將為哥倫比亞這個國家奉獻自己的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，在這座城市中，匯聚了無數的科技先鋒，他們是哥倫比亞科技發展的基石，說他們能左右這個國家的未來，也並不過分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你明白我的意思嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使在哥倫比亞最成熟的軍工廠流水線上，生產一枚標準炮彈的時間也要一天半。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更不談它被送往戰場，真正為我們的士兵所掌握要花費的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從容，上校。越是面對“弧光一號”這種能夠改變整片大地局勢的超級武器，我們越應該從容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是哥倫比亞，不是薩爾貢，也不是玻利瓦爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些年，軍方，確切地說，國防部在國家軍事能力上不斷探索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "整體而言，步伐邁得還算穩健。在總統看來，這是一種良性發展，因而樂見其成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，近年來國際局勢不斷變化，尤其是維多利亞碎片大廈的出現，讓一些事情改變了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那樣可怕的超級武器，讓距離不再成為距離，所有的地面防禦都將形同虛設，風暴帶來的煙塵隨時可能落在我們的枕頭上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "國防部內部主戰的聲音逐漸擴大，一些危險的苗頭已經開始出現了，他們把寶押在了具備同樣跨時代意義的戰略武器的研發上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克麗斯騰在這個時候進入了軍方的視野？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。克麗斯騰成為了軍方的核心技術顧問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她很快交出了代號“地平弧光計劃”的企劃案，計畫建造名為“弧光一號”的超級武器，並迅速落地執行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "軍方對此投入了大量的資源，萊茵生命也在很長一段時間裡，獲得了更多的政策支持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它能從特里蒙眾多的科技企業中脫穎而出，也與此有關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根據我們掌握的情報，建造“弧光一號”需要在特里蒙挖建複雜的能量井，並在飛行器的極限高度升起聚焦發生器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是一項龐大的工程，軍方幾乎傾盡全力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你面前的這個從天上砸下來的傢伙，想必就是計劃的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塞雷婭將視線從工廠的廢墟上移，看向天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "將天空作為中轉站？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "具體的概念設計與實現原理，我們並不清楚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "將天空作為中轉站，將巨量的能源進行聚焦或變向，從而實現在超遠距離發動強力打擊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "理論上說，這確實是可行的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但克麗斯騰真的會幫軍方建造所謂的超級武器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來，你沒有得到你想要的回覆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我從一開始就知道會這樣，只是現在更加確認了而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "合格的政治家從來不會擁有那麼明確的立場，起碼目前，他們不想我們那麼快地接管這個項目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們要怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很簡單，只需要拖延。如果說科學研究追求效率，那麼斐爾迪南，“拖延”就是這幫政客的慣用伎倆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當初辛嘉斯政府想要收回伍茲公司的林場而與議會協商，直到後者失去了對那塊區域的控制權，那場已經持續三年的談判都沒有結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們想拖著，拖到我們無法解決遇到的問題，拖到我們對那該死的“地平弧光計劃”喪失信心，直至不了了之。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斐爾迪南，你已經去過現場了吧，有什麼結論？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實是“弧光一號”中“聚焦發生器”的試飛版本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天空看似澄澈，但絕非淨土，克麗斯騰需要反覆試驗新的壓力和導航系統，這樣的試飛可能不止一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我更關注的是，“弧光一號”的底部能量井一直在軍方的控制之下，如此龐然巨物，克麗斯騰究竟是從什麼地方發射的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聚焦發生器的黑匣子還是沒有找到？透過黑匣子內的航線資料，我們可以鎖定發射地的位置，把克麗斯騰找出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經在十三區進行了全範圍搜索，一無所獲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人在第一時間回收了黑匣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會不會已經毀掉了，畢竟爆炸的威力那麼大......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克麗斯騰已經失蹤半月之久，憑藉黑匣子，克麗斯騰可能已經取得她想要的實驗結果，卻依然不想被我們找到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這意味著，軍方主持的所謂“地平弧光計劃”，已經完全脫離了軍方自己的控制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拖得越久，變數越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，傑克遜根本沒打算和我們好好談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？我當然對您沒有任何隱瞞......您問派去監視克麗斯騰的那批特工......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。我不會讓步，我會盡快解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......等等，您說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerToken": null,
