    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這倒是連我也不知道的秘辛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但克麗斯騰與史蒂芬森的關係算不上融洽，她繼承了父母對於天空的執念，而且並不希冀別人的理解。"
