    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，你此刻出現在這裡，依然是為了那個莽撞的孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是說，你也有自己的想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有沒有可能，我出現在這裡，是因為我確實在十三區購買了一處住宅？不那麼忙的時候，我會過來住上兩天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我老了，錫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倒不是說年紀有多大，只是回過神來的時候，我發現自己的健康、夢想、友誼、家庭......都已經奉獻給了這個國家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梅蘭德的“晨星”，最終什麼都沒能剩下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我自己甚至都沒有年輕時拍的那些電影的錄影，來緬懷一下所謂的“青春”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我並沒有責難你的意思，雅拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但如果你希望我能因此睜一隻眼閉一隻眼的話，恕我很難答應......梅蘭德只對這個國家負有責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是想告訴你，我不曾後悔。所以即使是現在，我也不會真的去傷害這個國家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雅拉，你至今仍在為萊特夫婦的死耿耿於懷吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然很想否認，但直到現在，當時的景象依然會出現在我的夢裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有您的快遞，請簽收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放在操作台上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霍爾海雅打量著眼前的空間，這是一個巨大的地下中空環形建築，換句話說，一口“井”。\n井壁上的內嵌源石燈只提供了基礎的照明，無法判斷整體的縱深。貼著牆壁的隱藏溝槽裡鋪設著纜線，向更黑暗的地方延展開去。\n剛剛說話的人正在來回走動，只留給她一個忙碌的背影。\n對方似乎在測試什麼，在如此深幽的空間，她的動作卻沒有激起多大的回聲，想必立面結構採用了什麼超性能的吸音材料。\n整個空間像是沉默在靜止的薄霧裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不怕黑嗎？你不覺得悶嗎？地下幾百米欸......上面還有那些粗魯的軍人巡邏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你都待了幾個多月了，沒出去走走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "娜斯提？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我很忙，羽蛇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也沒有閒著啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是說，把黑匣子放下，你就可以走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我冒險在軍方和梅蘭德的眼皮子底下給你送東西，這個態度不好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是你與總轄的交易，與我無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你拿到黑匣子後，沒有動過吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你回答得太過乾脆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "數據解算......嗯，並不算複雜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "娜斯提自顧自地忙碌起來，海量的數據在螢幕上刷新，像是潮水漫過陸地。\n娜斯提越來越認真起來，霍爾海雅被晾在了一邊，只能繼續盯著她的背影看。霍爾海雅注意到了她腰間的裝置——\n它們像是一節節被毫無規律拼接起來的枯枝，但隨著娜斯提在終端上操作或停頓，它們有節奏地擺動著，短促而規律。\n像是有生命般，它們似乎在跟隨娜斯提思考......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來你確實為無根的枯枝找到了養分......嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "航線軌跡數據較之前的演算稍有偏離，但在預期範圍內，看來傳導物質確實可以作為替代的導航材料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然如此，應該加快速度了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，克麗斯騰是怎麼讓你這位工程科主任心甘情願在地下替她做苦力活的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "娜斯提沒有回答，她輸入了幾道指令，等到眼前的螢幕一一熄滅，便向門口的方向走去，在她身後，這處地下的空間越來越暗淡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要出門了嗎，娜斯提？有了什麼好消息？難道你不該和我分享這份喜悅嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霍爾海雅應聲向後退了一步，她的身體自動執行了那道指令，如果那算是“指令”的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可愛的咒術，女妖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你手底下的那些職員有沒有和你抱怨過，你脾氣其實很差？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "冰冷的氣流撫過娜斯提的脖頸，又如錯覺般消失無蹤，年輕的女妖微微打了個哆嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一道貫穿的裂紋在她手中的骨筆上蔓延開來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呀，是這支筆品質不好嗎？我可知道，你有一抽屜備用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，我一直很好奇，如果把你的所有骨筆都折斷了，你還能用出這些小伎倆嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不會下第二遍同樣的命令，羽蛇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧好吧，女妖都這麼愛較真嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別耽誤了你這次難得的出門，如果你怕黑，我們可以一起走一段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在女妖再開口之前，霍爾海雅的身影輕巧地消失在了門後。\n空氣中的黑暗劇烈抖動了一陣，娜斯提最終放下了語言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該去接她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜斯提",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）終於，渾濁的夢要沉澱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
